DATA LICENCES — the code above is MIT; the datasets under src/data/ are not.

  src/data/exits.json, stations.json
    Contains information from the Land Transport Authority accessed via
    data.gov.sg and LTA DataMall, under the Singapore Open Data Licence.
    https://data.gov.sg/open-data-licence

  src/data/landmarks.json
    Derived from OpenStreetMap data, © OpenStreetMap contributors.
    Available under the Open Database Licence (ODbL) 1.0. As a Derived
    Database, redistribution must keep it under ODbL.
    https://opendatacommons.org/licenses/odbl/

  src/data/trivia.json, trivia.translated.json
    Text from Wikipedia, CC BY-SA 4.0. Opening dates from Wikidata, CC0.
    Translations are machine-generated from the Wikipedia text and inherit
    CC BY-SA 4.0.

  src/data/estimates.json
    Computed from the LTA exit data above; inherits the Singapore Open Data
    Licence terms of its source.
